    "body": "I think this change may fix some exsiting bugs in the wild, though I don't have data. If this change does break more sites than it fixes, I'd suggest add some opt-in messure, like:\n\n``` html\n<iframe src=\"about:blank?type=xhtml|html|inherit\" />\n```\n\n`inherit` means inherit the XHTML-ness of its parent.\n",
