    "updated_at": "2016-03-30T06:49:42Z",
    "body": "I see. If your only problem is `tagName` I think a much simpler solution would be to use `localName` instead. As you can see in https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-element-localname that will not return an uppercased result in HTML documents.\n",
